
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/members

### 1. List all members -> 200
GET {{base}}

### 2. Get one member -> 200
GET {{base}}/1

### 3. Unknown member -> 404
GET {{base}}/999

### 4. Create a member -> 201
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Layla Hassan",
  "email": "layla@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "55520003"
}

### 5. Same email again -> 409
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Another Person",
  "email": "layla@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "55520004"
}

### 6. Invalid member -> 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "phoneNumber": ""
}

### 7. Bookings of member 1 -> 200
GET {{base}}/1/bookings

### 8. Bookings of unknown member -> 404
GET {{base}}/999/bookings
